1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path></svg>Notify Me</button></div></div><form class=\"modal-backdrop\" method=\"dialog\"><button>close</button></form></dialog></div></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Expert Verdict</h2><p class=\"text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed mb-6\">The Galaxy A07 is suitable for casual users who prioritize battery life and camera performance. It&#x27;s an excellent choice for those who want a large display and a reliable processor. However, it may not be the best fit for heavy gamers or power users.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-success/10 border border-success/30 p-5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-success mb-3\">👍 Pros</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-success mt-0.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>Long-lasting 6000 mAh battery</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-success mt-0.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>Large 6.7-inch display with a high screen-to-body ratio</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-success mt-0.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>Capable 50 MP primary camera with PDAF</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-success mt-0.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>Efficient Mediatek Dimensity 6300 processor</li></ul></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-error/10 border border-error/30 p-5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-error mb-3\">👎 Cons</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-error mt-0.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>Limited RAM options, with a maximum of 6GB</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-error mt-0.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>No advanced camera features like optical zoom or ultra-wide lens</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-error mt-0.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg>No water or dust resistance</li></ul></div></div></section><section><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold\">📊 Benchmarks</h2><a href=\"/benchmarks\